# core.autocrlf=true on this Windows checkout hands shell scripts back as CRLF,
# and a CRLF shebang fails on the Linux GPU server with
#   /usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory
# Scope this to shell scripts only: widening it to yaml/jsonl would renormalise
# most of the repo in one commit for no functional gain (those parsers accept
# CRLF).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
